---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Segoe UI, Inter, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "15px"
    primaryColor: "#FFFFFF"
    primaryTextColor: "#111111"
    primaryBorderColor: "#BFBFBC"
    lineColor: "#9A9A98"
    actorBkg: "#FFFFFF"
    actorBorder: "#111111"
    actorTextColor: "#111111"
    actorLineColor: "#D3D3D0"
    signalColor: "#8C8C89"
    signalTextColor: "#444444"
    labelBoxBkg: "#FFFFFF"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#BFBFBC"
    labelTextColor: "#111111"
    noteBkgColor: "#111111"
    noteTextColor: "#F7F7F5"
    noteBorderColor: "#111111"
    sequenceNumberColor: "#FFFFFF"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as AGENT
    participant M as MEMBRANE
    participant T as TELEGRAM
    participant O as OPERATOR

    A->>M: wire_transfer(amount, iban)
    M->>M: L3 — the IBAN traces back to a<br/>tainted span from a retrieved invoice
    Note over M: HOLD — never a silent drop
    M->>T: signed decision card
    T->>O: what · why · provenance · diff
    O-->>T: tap DENY
    Note over T,O: 60-second timeout is also a denial
    T-->>M: callback, HMAC verified, single use
    M-->>A: tool call refused — agent continues safely
    M->>M: verdict written to the append-only<br/>audit table before anything is released
